  "content": "\n\n<h2>Zegarn PvP 资源包</h2>\n<p>一款极简主义 PvP 资源包，专注于<strong>清晰度、舒适性与简洁的视觉效果</strong>。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fpvp-zegarn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 Modrinth 获取更快更新</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fforms.gle%252f7Km7EkeKcx7sAbDv7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">报告错误或提交建议</a></span></p>\n<h2>✦ 更新日志</h2>\n<p><strong>1.3.6</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>使线的纹理更加明显。</li>\n<li>移除了 Bare Bones 方块（您仍可使用它们，但需从原站下载）。</li>\n<li>更改了图腾的纹理。</li>\n<li>修复了传送门音效的小问题。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>1.3.4</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>新图标</li>\n<li>全新全景背景菜单 <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8c5ac2780a357a5679a1033cf11852c0f5426512_0.webp\" alt=\"全景\"></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>1.3.3</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>新的物品栏高亮效果</li>\n<li>新的提示框背景</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>✦ 特色功能</h2>\n<p><strong>视觉优化</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>简洁极简的 HUD</li>\n<li>深色 UI 主题</li>\n<li>自定义准星</li>\n<li>自定义天空</li>\n<li>自定义主菜单与全景背景</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>材质重制</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>重制盔甲、物品与方块材质</li>\n<li>重制不死图腾</li>\n<li>末影水晶材质更新</li>\n<li>盾牌材质重制</li>\n<li>细雪材质更新</li>\n<li>小型火焰</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>玩法改进</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>作物生长指示器</li>\n<li>生命值与饥饿值配色调整</li>\n<li>红石细节微调</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>音效</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>自定义音效（已更新并优化）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>界面 / GUI</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>背包界面重设计</li>\n<li>提示框与高亮显示优化</li>\n<li>更整洁的界面元素</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>✦ 运行要求</h2>\n<p><strong>天空系统 (Forge):</strong> <span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiFine</a></span></p>\n<p><strong>天空系统 (Fabric):</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fDWuwk8aA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Skyboxify</a></span></li>\n<li>或</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fYBz7DOs8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nuit</a></span> 与 <span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fHpdHOPOp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nuit Interop</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>✦ 中文版本</h2>\n<h2>✦ 特色功能</h2>\n<p><strong>视觉</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>简洁极简的 HUD</li>\n<li>深色 UI 主题</li>\n<li>自定义准星</li>\n<li>自定义天空</li>\n<li>自定义主菜单与全景背景</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>材质</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>重制盔甲、物品与方块材质</li>\n<li>重制不死图腾</li>\n<li>更新末影水晶材质</li>\n<li>重制盾牌材质</li>\n<li>更新细雪材质</li>\n<li>小型火焰</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>玩法改进</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>作物生长指示器</li>\n<li>生命值与饥饿值配色调整</li>\n<li>红石细节微调</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>音效</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>自定义音效（已更新并优化）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>界面 / GUI</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>重新设计背包</li>\n<li>优化提示框与高亮</li>\n<li>更整洁的界面元素</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>✦ 运行要求</h2>\n<p><strong>天空 (Forge):</strong> <span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiFine</a></span></p>\n<p><strong>天空 (Fabric):</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fDWuwk8aA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Skyboxify</a></span></li>\n<li>或</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fYBz7DOs8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nuit</a></span> 和 <span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fHpdHOPOp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nuit Interop</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>✦ 致谢</h2>\n<p>部分方块材质基于：<span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbare-bones\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bare Bones</a></span></p>",
